      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.41,
      "end_seconds": 13.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.18,
      "end_seconds": 17.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.89,
      "end_seconds": 28.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "I've been putting on weight over the last year. I did try to ignore it for a while."
