      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.99,
      "end_seconds": 41.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "so, nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.06,
      "end_seconds": 69.33,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.7 degrees, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And pressure 110 over 81, heart rate 74. Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.93,
      "end_seconds": 80.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "About... well, six months. Ah, I'd been feeling out of breath on stairs, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.63,
      "end_seconds": 86.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "A few quick ones: heat intolerance, low mood or palpitations?"
