      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.85,
      "end_seconds": 259.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "okay, um, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.05,
      "end_seconds": 263.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.5,
      "end_seconds": 282.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Your waist measures about a hundred and four centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.42,
      "end_seconds": 304.02,
      "duration_seconds": 15.6,
      "text": "So, that's the examination finished. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like weight gain with a metabolic cause that needs checking. I wanna be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.51,
      "end_seconds": 308.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.15,
      "end_seconds": 327.01,
      "duration_seconds": 16.86,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's weight gain with a metabolic cause that needs checking, and we'll watch how it goes let's get you seen by a dietitian, I'll arrange the letter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.04,
      "end_seconds": 328.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.36,
      "end_seconds": 338.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "I'll want another look after the results are back. How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.17,
      "end_seconds": 346.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "so, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.09,
      "end_seconds": 352.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
